            "author_association": "MEMBER",
            "body": "Skipping testing for all future versions should usually be done only if it is not needed. Here the test is needed, so the ideal approach is to make the test pass on both Nightly and non-Nightly. Unfortunately, this is somewhat verbose for screenshots, so the usual approach is to redo screenshots to be future compatible (i.e. on Nightly) and skip tests on not-Nightly.\n\nHowever, in this case I'd wait a bit to see how and if neovim/neovim#40431 is resolved.",
            "commit_id": "e12acce7a28cf0756ad70cc9ef540f3b99add676",
